<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>FixPrint — Broken Part Replacement</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f4f6f8;color:#17202a}
header{background:#111827;color:#fff;padding:18px 7%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.logo{font-size:24px;font-weight:800}.logo span{color:#ff7a00}header a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;margin-left:22px}
.hero{padding:70px 7%;text-align:center;background:#fff}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,68px);margin:0 auto 18px;max-width:850px}.hero h1 span{color:#ff7a00}
.hero p{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 28px;font-size:20px;color:#59636e}.button{display:inline-block;background:#ff7a00;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 24px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}
.section{padding:55px 7%;max-width:1100px;margin:auto}.section h2{font-size:34px;text-align:center}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:30px}.card{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}
.number{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff7a00;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800}
form{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.07);max-width:700px;margin:25px auto 0}
label{display:block;font-weight:700;margin:17px 0 7px}input,textarea{width:100%;padding:13px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:9px;font-size:16px}
textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}.notice{background:#fff4e8;border-left:4px solid #ff7a00;padding:13px;margin-top:18px;border-radius:7px}
footer{background:#111827;color:#cbd5e1;text-align:center;padding:30px;margin-top:30px}
@media(max-width:700px){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}header{padding:16px 5%}header nav{display:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="logo">Fix<span>Print</span></div><nav><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#request">Request a part</a></nav></header>

<section class="hero">
<h1>Broken plastic part?<br><span>We can print a replacement.</span></h1>
<p>Send us pictures and measurements of your broken knob, clip, bracket, cover, or other plastic part. We'll check whether we can recreate it.</p>
<a class="button" href="#request">Request a replacement</a>
</section>

<section class="section" id="how"><h2>How it works</h2><div class="steps">
<div class="card"><div class="number">1</div><h3>Show us the broken part</h3><p>Upload clear photos and tell us what the part came from.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="number">2</div><h3>We design it</h3><p>We measure, model, and choose a suitable printing material.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="number">3</div><h3>Get your replacement</h3><p>After the design is approved, the replacement can be printed.</p></div>
</div></section>

<section class="section" id="request"><h2>Request a replacement</h2>
<form action="https://formsubmit.co/YOUR_EMAIL_HERE@example.com" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
<input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New FixPrint replacement-part request">
<input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table">
<input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="true">

<label>Your name</label><input name="name" required placeholder="Your name">
<label>Email</label><input name="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com">
<label>What is broken?</label><input name="broken_part" required placeholder="Example: washing machine knob">
<label>What does it belong to?</label><input name="device_model" placeholder="Brand + model if known">
<label>Photos of the broken part</label><input name="attachment" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" multiple>
<label>Measurements / details</label><textarea name="details" placeholder="Diameter, height, hole size, where it broke, etc."></textarea>
<div class="notice">⚠️ Don't send parts that could create a safety risk if incorrectly reproduced, such as critical vehicle, medical, gas, electrical, or structural components.</div>
<br><button class="button" type="submit">Send request</button>
</form></section>
<footer>FixPrint — Turning broken plastic into replacement parts.</footer>
</body>
</html>
